WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
It was driven by all our core geographies.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:04.780
You can see here in the middle panel,

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:08.180
U.S. weekly TRX reached another record high.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.960
That 25% growth was fueled by consistent demand

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.120
across the various segments that we competed.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.400
Outside of the U.S., growth was 30%,

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.900
with strong contribution from China and Japan,

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.940
where we continue to see momentum from Entresto in heart failure,

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.180
but importantly as well in hypertension.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:31.000
So we remain confident in the continued sustained performance of the medicine.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:36.380
For forecasting purposes, we continue to assume an Entresto LOE in mid-2025.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:41.100
However, we continue to enforce our patents and litigate our patents

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.900
and will ensure that we maximize this brand for as long as possible in the United States,

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.960
alongside EU RDP in November of 2026.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.400
Then moving to slide seven,

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.880
Cosentix grew at 22% in the quarter,

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:57.640
and this is fueled by our new launches.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.260
And I think importantly, if you take a step back,

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:05.860
puts us well on our trajectory to reach $7 billion plus peak sales for Cosentix.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:09.140
When you look at the demand growth by geography,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.520
the U.S. grew 34%, driven by volume.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.680
Ex-U.S., we were up 10%.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:18.740
And this was partially offset by one-time pricing effects

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.920
due in Germany in particular,

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:23.760
due to the addition of additional new indication,

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.800
normal part of the German process.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:29.080
As you get additional indications, you do see price adjustments.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:32.840
We see Cosentix doing very well in its core indications.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.180
I think one important dynamic is the strong launch in HS

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:41.600
is supporting us in our core indications of psoriasis, PSA, and AS.

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.860
We're the number one IL-17 in the U.S. dynamic market,

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:48.540
the lead originator biologic in Europe and China.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:52.640
In HS, we're seeing a very strong uptake with market leadership,

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:55.600
a share over 60% in the NBRX.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:57.560
In Germany, we're over 50%.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:00.240
And I think importantly, with the launch of Cosentix,

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:03.800
we're seeing increased diagnosis and desire to treat

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.940
amongst physicians and patients,

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:08.620
which I think will allow the HS market to grow

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.800
to larger than it's historically been.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.400
And of course, allow Cosentix to help these patients

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.300
achieve their treatment goals.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.340
For Cosentix IV, we saw solid adoption

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:20.880
with over 700 accounts now ordering.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:24.520
And we do expect further demand increases in the second half

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.660
now that we have a permanent,

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:28.280
day code in effect as of July 1.

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:31.260
So moving to slide A,

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.500
Cosentix also delivered, as I mentioned,

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.540
a very strong quarter two, 65% growth.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:41.080
This was broad-based in terms of its geographic growth profile.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:44.560
Over 100,000 patients have now been treated worldwide,

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.060
naive or first switch with Cosentix.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.240
In the U.S., we saw 49% growth.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.260
This demand growth was driven by TRX volume of 43%

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:55.080
versus prior year.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:55.860
We gained.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:59.120
We have a 34% market share overall in segments.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:02.120
Outside of the U.S., we have NBRX leadership

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.920
in seven out of 10 major markets.

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:08.420
So looking forward, we feel confident we will exceed

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:12.220
our Cosentix $4 billion guidance, peak sales guidance.

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.260
We see strong trajectory for this brand.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:15.760
Its profile is unique,

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.440
self-administered B cell treatment option,

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:23.100
one minute a month dosing, no steroid pretreatment required,

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.780
an attractive safety profile with respect

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.680
to injection site reactions, persistence and adherence.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:32.160
We're seeing in the real world setting is comparable

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:33.940
to infuse B cell therapies.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.280
We also continue to generate data

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:39.860
which support the strong efficacy profile of this medicine.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:45.850
To move to slide nine, Cascalli grew 50%

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:48.370
in the metastatic setting with now leading

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:52.670
or continued leading NBRX share in the U.S. and ex-U.S.

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:55.890
As you know, Cascalli has an outstanding data profile

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:56.790
in the metastatic breast cancer setting.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:00.030
That's really supporting us consistently now.

